# Terraform
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
terraform/crash.log
terraform/crash.*.log
terraform/*.tfvars
terraform/*.tfvars.json
terraform/override.tf
terraform/override.tf.json

# Kubernetes
*.kubeconfig
# tehcyx/kind provider's own generated kubeconfig-context file (named "<cluster_name>-config"
# by the underlying kind CLI it wraps - confirmed empirically, not just documentation)
terraform/*-config

# Helm dependency artifacts (rebuild with `helm dependency build` - Chart.lock pins versions and
# IS committed, same as kart-infra's own pattern)
**/charts/*.tgz

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
